h which will be soon  uh then we'll have a discussion as to  what happens with the fencing and the  rest and people  are listening and respectful but also  we have to be careful and none of us i  mean maybe some of us are security  experts but  most of us would have to pay attention  to those  who are security and law enforcement  leaders who have made proposals to us  it'll be soon  our next question comes from monte raju  with cnn  yes okay thanks for taking my question  uh

